OL,3,GNEWSADaithi Mac Gabhann returns home
OL,4,Aafter heart transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-year-old boy who inspired
OL,7,Fchanges to Northern Ireland's organ
OL,8,Fdonation laws has spent his first night
OL,9,Fat home after receiving a heart
OL,10,Ftransplant.
OL,12,FAfter an eight-year wait, Daithi Mac
OL,13,FGabhann received a transplant in July,
OL,14,Fwith the operation being carried out at
OL,15,FFreeman Hospital in Newcastle upon
OL,16,FTyne.
OL,18,FFriends and neighbours cheered as he
OL,19,Freturned to his home in west Belfast
OL,20,Fafter several weeks in England.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
